{"id":"n83757-1-7","stage":5,"title":"품목 · 货单","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83757-1-7-1","ko":"칵테일이 아주 좋은데요.","zh":"这杯鸡尾酒很棒。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"칵테일이","meaning":"鸡尾酒","explanation":"칵테일：鸡尾酒；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"칵테일","audio":"/audio/f3ad00cd1778e6710d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81704","senseId":"1","lemma":"칵테일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"칵테일이","audio":"/audio/25e07a34b8997a7332d2.mp3"}},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}},{"text":"좋은데요.","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；은데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋은데요","audio":"/audio/7cd26e732ace040d8af8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f3ad00cd1778e671","term":"칵테일","zh":"鸡尾酒","audio":"/audio/f3ad00cd1778e6710d2b.mp3","entryId":"81704","definition":"在烈性洋酒中加入果汁或糖，并和冰块一起混合的酒。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/49c3dbf754c7eab7cc2d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83757-1-7-2","ko":"네, 우리 요리사가 자랑하는 품목 중에 하나예요.","zh":"是的，这是我们厨师引以为傲的拿手饮品之一。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"요리사가","meaning":"料理师，烹饪师，烹调师，厨师","explanation":"요리사：料理师，烹饪师，烹调师，厨师；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"요리사","audio":"/audio/c4b65734920ac48c9698.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26621","senseId":"1","lemma":"요리사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요리사가","audio":"/audio/a7a8cb16c7c3967c9093.mp3"}},{"text":"자랑하는","meaning":"炫耀，夸耀","explanation":"자랑하다：炫耀，夸耀；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"자랑하다","audio":"/audio/c5aaf5ec9bccf4c15659.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62348","senseId":"1","lemma":"자랑하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자랑하는","audio":"/audio/7663bd8f1849f7ec45d8.mp3"}},{"text":"품목","meaning":"货单，清单","explanation":"품목：货单，清单","readings":[{"term":"품목","audio":"/audio/1b0588013e861e296d1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83757","senseId":"1","lemma":"품목","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"품목","audio":"/audio/1b0588013e861e296d1f.mp3"}},{"text":"중에","meaning":"当中","explanation":"중：当中；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"1","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중에","audio":"/audio/f0d257645978930f07ec.mp3"}},{"text":"하나예요.","meaning":"一","explanation":"하나：一；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20279","senseId":"1","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나예요","audio":"/audio/aa76b6ae8c21284d4a50.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"c4b65734920ac48c","term":"요리사","zh":"料理师，烹饪师，烹调师，厨师","audio":"/audio/c4b65734920ac48c9698.mp3","entryId":"26621","definition":"以做料理为职业的人。","pronunciation":["요리사"]},{"id":"c5aaf5ec9bccf4c1","term":"자랑하다","zh":"炫耀，夸耀","audio":"/audio/c5aaf5ec9bccf4c15659.mp3","entryId":"62348","definition":"向别人说或显摆自己或和自己有关的人或物等值得被称赞的事。","pronunciation":["자랑하다"]},{"id":"1b0588013e861e29","term":"품목","zh":"货单，清单","audio":"/audio/1b0588013e861e296d1f.mp3","entryId":"83757","definition":"按顺序书写物品名称的单子。","pronunciation":["품ː목"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"当中","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"多个中。","pronunciation":["중"]},{"id":"556dcbf069a950eb","term":"하나","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3","entryId":"20279","definition":"数数时的第一个数字。","pronunciation":["하나"]}],"audio":"/audio/86c78c043cb5a80a9f10.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.58,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=83757","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":173,"sequenceScore":3.4067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的，这是我们厨师引以为傲的拿手饮品之一。","这杯鸡尾酒很棒。","那栋建筑亮闪闪的，真是太华丽了！"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这杯鸡尾酒很棒。","那栋建筑亮闪闪的，真是太华丽了！","是的，这是我们厨师引以为傲的拿手饮品之一。"],"answer":2}]}
